| **Llamada al endpoint** | [`js/*.js`](js) | `fetch('/api/auth/login', { method: 'POST' })` |
| **Servidor que escucha** | [`backend/server.js`](backend/server.js) | `app.use('/api/auth', authRoutes)` |

